"""
NMDC Project 20012 - WSR V13 Automation Module Blueprint for DPR Online App (thpp-survey-app)
File: wsr_blueprint.py
Mounts at: /wsr (and also runs standalone if executed directly via `python wsr_blueprint.py`)
Features:
- 1-Click Live Database Sync (/wsr/api/pull_db_week): Pulls Closed SurveyTasks & Open Actions directly from your DPR SQL database.
- Page-1 Admin Tables Editor (/wsr/api/admin_tables): Full CRUD + Yellow Highlight support for Tables 1, 2, and 3 (persisted to both WSR_Master_Template_V8.docx and AppConfig SQL table).
- 2-Week AI Context Engine (/wsr/api/ai_generate) & Per-Box Executive Polisher (/wsr/api/ai_polish).
- Cross-Platform Word & PDF Commit Engine (/wsr/api/commit): Uses docx2pdf on Windows or LibreOffice on Linux/Render.
"""
